@host = http://localhost:5000

### Ca 1: GET / - Kiểm tra trạng thái máy chủ (Kỳ vọng: 200 OK)
GET {{host}}/

### Ca 2: GET /api/assignments - Lấy danh sách bài tập (Kỳ vọng: 200 OK)
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### Ca 3: POST /api/assignments/1/submissions - Tạo lượt nộp hợp lệ (Kỳ vọng: 201 Created + Location)
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### Ca 4: GET /api/submissions/{id} - Đọc lại trạng thái lượt nộp (Kỳ vọng: 200 OK, received -> processing -> graded)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Ca 5: POST /api/assignments/1/submissions - Thiếu thông tin (Kỳ vọng: 400 Bad Request)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### Ca 6: POST /api/assignments/999/submissions - Nộp vào bài tập không tồn tại (Kỳ vọng: 404 Not Found)
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/signalr"
}

### Ca 7: GET /api/submissions/{id} - Lấy lượt nộp không tồn tại (Kỳ vọng: 404 Not Found)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Ca 8: POST /hubs/submissions/negotiate - Bắt tay kết nối SignalR (Kỳ vọng: 200 OK + connectionId)
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### Ca 9: POST /hub/submissions/negotiate - Bắt tay sai endpoint (Kỳ vọng: 404 Not Found)
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
